--- README.md
+++ README.md
@@ -94,9 +94,18 @@ Supported formats include **PNG** (including Apple CgBI), **JPEG**, **JPEG 2000*
 
 ### Requirements
 
+Rendering needs an **OpenGL 3.3 Core** context; on systems that cannot provide
+one (Mac OS X 10.6 and other legacy setups) the viewer falls back to an OpenGL
+2.x context and its GLSL 110 shader path. OpenGL 2.0 is the hard minimum.
+
+The OpenGL loader is generated at build time, so the
+[glad](https://github.com/Dav1dde/glad) Python package (>= 2.0, *glad2* on
+PyPI) is required to build; it is not needed at runtime.
+
 | Library  | Debian package       | Fedora package       | Required | Notes                           |
 | :------- | :------------------- | :------------------- | :------: | :------------------------------ |
 | CMake    | cmake                | cmake                | yes      | Build system (>= 3.22)         |
+| glad     | python3-glad2        | python3-glad2        | yes      | Generates the OpenGL loader     |
 | OpenGL   | libgl1-mesa-dev      | mesa-libGL-devel     | yes      | Hardware-accelerated rendering  |
 | GLFW3    | libglfw3-dev         | glfw-devel           | yes      | Window and input management     |
 | zlib     | zlib1g-dev           | zlib-devel           | yes      | Compression                     |
